Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fire giant is a being\Nmade entirely of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My flowers cannot destroy such a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I doubt they could\Nhold it off for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.13,0:02:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we don't need that much time,\Njust enough to get up close to Chudelkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.31,0:03:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For ten seconds. No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps less than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll draw its attention while you attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do not advance too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what the Pontifex is waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swarm my flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for her eyes. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, you residents!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,M &M's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was rather anticlimactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did gain some useful information from\Nit, though, so it's not a total loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unsightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heartless creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, irregular boy, I think I've\Nfigured out the mystery of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.67,0:05:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought I couldn't see your\Nproperties because you were unregistered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An illegitimate birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't feel threatened by me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the same authority\Nlevel as everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nowhere near as high as yours,\Nthat's for sure, Administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Queen Alne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that little imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's filled your head\Nwith ridiculous stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, boy, what are you doing in my world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you just stumbled\Nin out of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your world's gonna end real soon,\Nand it's gonna be all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'll\Ndestroy it? Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Territory will invade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you made the\NIntegrity Knights, to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your faith in them's your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds exactly like something\Nthat little brat would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both her for being so desperate to have me\Nexpelled, and you for being so gullible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Pontifex, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The army of the Dark has grown rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they invade now, the current\Nnumber of knights cannot withstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commander believed so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As did Vice Commander Fanatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.07,0:07:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your plan now that the\NOrder of Knights is no more?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you alone\Ncan protect the Empire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what angers me more than your hubris?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have stolen us knights from our\Nparents, from wives and husbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.99,0:07:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sealed away our memories\Nof them and replaced them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with lies of being summoned\Nfrom a non-existent heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pontifex, could you not trust us to be\Nloyal to you and respect your authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were we such a threat to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:08:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to submit us to such a monstrous\Nritual and force our souls into obedience?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.07,0:08:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do trust you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The piety module installed in\NUnites is proof of my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gift from me to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, this little thing frees you from\Nthe worry and pain of normal folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are my beautiful dolls,\Nbeautiful for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.41,0:08:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of all the knights, uncle, Commander\NBercouli has shown you the deepest loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you do not know the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though he has served you\Nfaithfully for 300 long years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think he did not\Nsuffer once in all that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.43,0:08:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you not know of the pain\Nhe carried in his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you that oblivious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so little of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things you speak of didn't start\Nbothering Bercouli recently, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He brought them up ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A century, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, about that, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't watch him brood\Nover such trivialities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I fixed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reset him, to be more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he was not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I reset every night\Nmore than a century old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of their painful memories and\Ntroubling thoughts were wiped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll overlook your\Ntransgressions and erase
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the thoughts that\Nmake you so miserable,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, you'll go back to\Nbeing my puppet and have no need to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.83,0:09:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I feel enough sadness\Nand pain to tear my heart to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I choose to embrace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not wish to erase what\NI have never felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pain serves a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human being and not a puppet knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Pontifex, I do not want your so-called\Nlove, and I do not need you to fix me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, what you\Nwant doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I resynthesize you, and I will,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pesky feelings that trouble\Nyou now will be erased completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kind of like what you did to yourself\Nway back when, huh, Quinella?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.45,0:10:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dredging up the past is\Nconsidered quite rude. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You scared the truth will come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's got the power to erase the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were born a human and raised a human,\Nand no matter how much power you got,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's one thing you\Ncan't change, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure what you're getting\Nat, little boy from the outer world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you want is to be a god, but you\Ncan never be a god because you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being human means you make\Nmistakes, and you made a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, there's\Nnothing you can do to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got less Integrity Knights now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Dark Territory invades,\Nwho's going to stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who was the one who corrupted\Nsome of my best knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're all that's left after this, maybe\Nyou can start over with a clean slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's what you always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.51,0:11:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, it ain't gonna\Ngo the way you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's the people who created this world
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and have final say over\Nwhat happens to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they see the human empire fall,\Nthey'll think, Oh well, that didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, one of them will push a\Nbutton and everything will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.03,0:11:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.11,0:11:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every person here and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll erase it all\Nin the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have a feeling the\Nsame goes for your world too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have a creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your kind grapple with the thought of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,living under the whim of\Na higher power as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you strive to please this being,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obeying its laws, hoping it won't\Ntire of you and wipe you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would be shocked if that were the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your kind created our\Nworld, and if we fail them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would delete us without a care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is how your kind treat us, boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you do not have the\Nright to criticize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.37,0:12:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I reject their authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not pander to self-proclaimed gods
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,groveling for the right\Nto continue existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refute them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I exist for one reason alone,\Nto rule over all in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That singular desire is what\Ndrives me and gives me life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are for climbing over\Nothers to greater heights,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not to bend at the knee in subjugation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna sit back and let\Nthe human empire get destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna watch everything burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alone on your token throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a queen with no one to rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I will not allow\Nyour kind to reset the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nor will I allow the final load test?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to run its course either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a new sacred\Nart to counter that, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will be witnesses, the\Nfirst to test my creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.21,0:13:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Knights were a stopgap, and\Nthey have served their purpose well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The military force I require should\Nnot think, or feel, or remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In battle, those are distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My perfect soldier relentlessly massacres\Nwhatever enemy stands before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately, what I require is not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake and destroy your\Nenemy, my faithful servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my soulless exterminator!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release Recollection!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she done? Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Discharge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.97,0:15:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using perfect weapon control in\N30 at once should be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even for the Pontifex.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It violates the sacred arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.85,0:15:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, the power I have sought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.69,0:15:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offensive might with no equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soldier that will fight forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what shall I call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sword Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a walking sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.65,0:16:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one of its blades has the\Npriority level of a divine object.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stretched my precious memory\Ncapacity to the limit to create this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, go forth and fight, my golem!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and annihilate your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.97,0:16:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your dagger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stab the levitating disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, he made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy I got to fight\Nwith you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.37,0:19:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's Cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the good Cardinal of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two hundred years ago, she fought\NAdministrator, but she had to go into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She saved Eugeo and me and\Nguided us into the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one loves this world more than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust the warmth of her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for healing me, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stubborn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I not relieve you of your duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I not thank you\Nfor all your hard work?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just\Nstay on your bookshelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she have a Fluctlight too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To borrow a term from your\Nworld, Charlotte was like an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.31,0:21:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she risked her life to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not something an NPC would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if she didn't have a soul, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This child had been alive for 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was my constant companion, and she\Nwatched over a number of people for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the past two years, she was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After spending all that time with someone,\None doesn't need a Fluctlight to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the nature of an intelligence is\Njust a collection of input and output data,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is still possible for it\Nto have a true soul within.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in some cases, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A concept you'll never\Nunderstand as long as you live!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.15,0:21:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Administrator, you wretched woman!
